---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHeader from '../components/PageHeader.astro';
import Cta from '../components/Cta.astro';
---
<Base
  title="About — psiberAI"
  description="psiberAI is an independent security and AI advisory for regulated enterprises — vendor-neutral, standards-led, focused on evidence over assertion."
>
  <PageHeader
    eyebrow="About"
    title="Independent security & AI advisory."
    lead="psiberAI helps regulated enterprises get ahead of the quantum threat and stay audit-ready across information security and AI governance. Everything we hand over is something you can verify yourself."
  />

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <h2>What we believe</h2>
      <p>
        Security advice should come with <strong>proof</strong>. When we flag a risk, you see the
        inventory entry it came from, not a severity score we invented. When we say you're covered, you
        get evidence an auditor will accept. If we can't show you something, it doesn't go in the report.
      </p>
      <p>
        We're <strong>vendor-neutral by design</strong>. We don't resell products or take referral
        fees, so an assessment answers one question: what's actually right for your estate. That
        independence is the point of hiring an outside opinion in the first place.
      </p>

      <h2>What we focus on</h2>
      <p>
        Our lead practice is <a href="/services/pqc-migration">post-quantum cryptography migration</a> —
        helping organizations find their cryptographic exposure and plan the multi-year transition to
        the NIST-standardized algorithms before "harvest-now, decrypt-later" becomes a breach. Around
        it we do the compliance work that regulated enterprises need:
        <a href="/services/iso-27001">ISO 27001</a> for information security and
        <a href="/services/iso-42001">ISO 42001</a> for AI governance. They overlap more than they look:
        the cryptographic inventory we build for PQC is also ISO 27001 evidence, so one piece of work
        often counts twice.
      </p>

      <h2>Who we work with</h2>
      <p>
        Regulated and data-sensitive organizations — finance, healthcare, technology, critical
        infrastructure — across the US, Europe, the UAE and Australia. If your data has to stay
        confidential for years, or you answer to auditors and regulators, we're built for you.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Cta />
</Base>
